      "source_text": "A <TEXTITOPEN_0001>split equalizer<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> is a diagram (<REF_0001>) with\n<MATH_0001> for which there exist auxiliary morphisms\n<MATH_0002> and <MATH_0003> such that\n<MATH_0004>\n",
