      "unit_id": "tag:08WF:prose-0002",
      "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe point is that the equalities among arrows force (<REF_0001>) \nto be an equalizer: the map <MATH_0001> factors uniquely through <MATH_0002> by writing\n<MATH_0003>. Consequently, applying a covariant functor\nto a split equalizer gives a split equalizer; applying a contravariant functor \ngives a <TEXTITOPEN_0001>split coequalizer<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>, whose definition is apparent.\n\n",
